た1対2の株式分割により単純比較ができませんが、株式分割後の株式数を基準とした参考値としての前期実績との比較においては、前期比10円増の50円となる予想です。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["PreviousReportingDate", "PreviousReportingDate", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2026年5月15日", null, "CurrentYearInstant"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 15, "15.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 30, "30.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 45, "45.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 20, "20.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 30, "30.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 50, "50.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 30, "30.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 25, "25.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["NoteToDividends", "NoteToDividends", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "※当社は2025年10月１日付で1対2の株式分割を行っております。前期実績の年間配当金については株式分割の実施により単純合計できませんが、参考として株式分割考慮後の株式数を基準とした配当金額の合計を表示しております。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["FiscalYearEnd", "FiscalYearEnd", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2027-03-31", null, "CurrentYearInstant"]]}}